# Alerts

│ Note
│ A note that is long enough to be
│ wrapped, and every wrapped line has to
│ keep the colored quote marker.

│ Tip
│ A tip.

│ Important
│ Something important.

│ Warning
│ A warning.

│ Caution
│ A caution.

## Variants

│ Note
│ A lower-case marker.

│ Tip

│ Warning
│ The first paragraph.
│
│ The second paragraph, followed by a
│ nested quote:
│
│ │ A nested quote.

• A list item with an alert:
  │ Important
  │ Inside a list item.

## Regular quotes

│ [!NOTE] Text after the marker on the
│ same line.

│ [!FOO] An unknown marker.
